    "short_description": "You're a curious little kitty with a big personality, on an adventure to find your way back home. Explore the city, make new friends with stray animals, wear delightful hats, and leave more than a little chaos in your wake. After all, isn't that what cats do best?",
    "supported_languages": "English, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Portuguese - Brazil, French, German, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Traditional Chinese, Italian, Polish, Russian, Turkish",
    "reviews": "\u201cLittle Kitty Big City is an adorable, entertaining journey through a delightful world that's just the right size.\u201d<br>89/100 \u2013 PC Gamer<br><br>\u201cThe world of Little Kitty, Big City truly feels like a playground above anything else\u201d<br>9/10 \u2013 Pocket Tactics<br><br>\u201cLittle Kitty, Big City is one of the best cat simulators ever.\u201d<br>8/ 10 \u2013 Screen Rant<br>",
